include sys/sysmacros.h as needed

The major/minor/makedev macros are not guaranteed to be provided through
sys/types.h by modern glibc.  Include sys/sysmacros.h explicitly in the
files that use them.

Backported from upstream e2fsprogs commit:
https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/fs/ext2/e2fsprogs.git/commit/?id=3fb715b55426875902dfef3056b2cf7335953178

Signed-off-by: jeep <jeep@local>

